OL,3,GNEWSAThe science park workers who don't
OL,4,Aneed a lab coat
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Cambridge can be a daunting place for
OL,7,Fpeople without a PhD."
OL,9,FThat is how Kath Austin, 47, felt when
OL,10,Fshe moved to the city 20 years ago.
OL,12,FIt is perhaps not surprising. Alongside
OL,13,Fits world-leading university, Cambridge
OL,14,Fis home to one of the most intensive
OL,15,Fscience and innovation clusters in the
OL,16,Fworld.
OL,18,FIt employs around 220,000 people within
OL,19,Fa 20-mile radius of the city centre and
OL,20,Fis still growing.
